:name: STM32F407VG_ADS1115_sensor
:description: STM32F407VG + ADS1115 (I2C1) - sensor modeli ile boot testi (Gorev 5)

using sysbus

$name?="STM32F407VG_ADS1115"
mach create $name

# 1) ONCE C# sensor modelini Renode'a tanit (calisma zamaninda derlenir).
include @renode-model/ADS1x1x.cs

# 2) Sonra platformu yukle -- platform.repl artik "I2C.ADS1x1x" tipini taniyor.
machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/platform.repl

# NOT: Debug klasorundeki .elf dosyanin gercek yolunu buraya yaz.
$bin?=@/mnt/c/Users/Administrator/Desktop/STM32F407VG_ADS1115/Debug/STM32F407VG_ADS1115.elf

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart1

# 3) Simule edilecek voltaji ayarla -- firmware bu degeri I2C uzerinden okuyacak.
#    Ornek: 1250mV -> ADS1115, +-2.048V PGA araliginda bu degeri ADC koduna cevirip donecek.
sysbus.i2c1.ads1x1x SimulatedVoltageMilliVolts 1250

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
